{"id":"n71113-2-8","stage":1,"title":"음료수 · 饮料","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71113-2-8-1","ko":"어떡해! 옷에 음료수를 흘렸어요.","zh":"怎么办！衣服上洒到饮料了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떡해!","meaning":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어떡하다：“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떡하다","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70480","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷에","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음료수를","meaning":"饮料","explanation":"음료수：饮料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음료수","audio":"/audio/aaae4e60029f5d1be170.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71113","senseId":"2","lemma":"음료수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흘렸어요.","meaning":"流出来，淌出来，撒出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，淌出来，撒出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"1","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"aaae4e60029f5d1b","term":"음료수","zh":"饮料","audio":"/audio/aaae4e60029f5d1be170.mp3","entryId":"71113","definition":"为了缓解口渴或因为好喝而喝的液体。","pronunciation":["음ː뇨수"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，淌出来，撒出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"使水或小粒的东西散落或掉落到外面。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/17d08857785169fe16a8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71113-2-8-2","ko":"토마토 주스라 붉은색 얼룩이 질 것 같네요.","zh":"是番茄汁，应该会留下红色污渍吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"토마토","meaning":"番茄，西红柿","explanation":"토마토：番茄，西红柿","readings":[{"term":"토마토","audio":"/audio/b72d4a4794833847785b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89390","senseId":"1","lemma":"토마토","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주스라","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붉은색","meaning":"红色","explanation":"붉은색：红色","readings":[{"term":"붉은색","audio":"/audio/f7c2f74d48489905e7ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61041","senseId":"1","lemma":"붉은색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼룩이","meaning":"斑渍，污渍，斑迹","explanation":"얼룩：斑渍，污渍，斑迹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼룩","audio":"/audio/bef1d31418ba1aa68d37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67308","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼룩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"질","meaning":"出现，形成","explanation":"지다：出现，形成；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27951","senseId":"1","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같네요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b72d4a4794833847","term":"토마토","zh":"番茄，西红柿","audio":"/audio/b72d4a4794833847785b.mp3","entryId":"89390","definition":"一种拳头大小的圆形果实，成熟时会由绿色变成红色。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"f7c2f74d48489905","term":"붉은색","zh":"红色","audio":"/audio/f7c2f74d48489905e7ef.mp3","entryId":"61041","definition":"如同熟透的辣椒或血液的颜色一样浓的赤色。","pronunciation":["불근색"]},{"id":"bef1d31418ba1aa6","term":"얼룩","zh":"斑渍，污渍，斑迹","audio":"/audio/bef1d31418ba1aa68d37.mp3","entryId":"67308","definition":"沾到液体等或液体等滲入后产生的痕迹。","pronunciation":["얼룩"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"出现，形成","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"27951","definition":"自然现象发生。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5e7c289aa8c99b93311d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.65,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71113","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.3034,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是番茄汁，应该会留下红色污渍吧。","怎么办！衣服上洒到饮料了。","你真的非得做那件事吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么办！衣服上洒到饮料了。","你真的非得做那件事吗？","是番茄汁，应该会留下红色污渍吧。"],"answer":2}]}
